OL,3,GNEWSARadio presenter's 'wobbles' over
OL,4,AChildren in Need cycling challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FRadio presenter Owain Wyn Evans has
OL,7,Fvoiced fears about his upcoming
OL,8,Fchallenge to cycle through all four UK
OL,9,Fnations for Children in Need.
OL,11,FThe host of BBC Radio 2's Early
OL,12,FBreakfast Show admitted he has had
OL,13,F"wobbles", adding: "I just don't feel
OL,14,Flike it's a thing I'm able to do."
OL,16,FIt will see him travel almost 400 miles
OL,17,F(643km), setting off from Glasgow and
OL,18,Ffinishing in Cardiff, and is the
OL,19,Fgreatest distance anyone has covered in
OL,20,Fa Radio 2 fundraising challenge.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
